## What this covers, and what it does not

**Upstream work.** nxrt contains code merged from three MIT-licensed projects. Their notices are kept, and those parts
stay under MIT as their authors require; everything added for nxrt is public domain:

```
Copyright (c) 2026 Peiikai                       LASRecomp    https://github.com/peiikai/LASRecomp
Copyright (c) 2026 Apolinario-coder               SkyRecomp    https://github.com/Apolinario-coder/SkyRecomp
Copyright (c) 2026 the EoWRecomp contributors     EoWRecomp    https://github.com/Nycolazs/EoWRecomp
```

**Bundled components.** Dear ImGui, SMAA, xxHash, the ReShade headers and the Baloo 2 font keep their own licenses;
[THIRD_PARTY.md](THIRD_PARTY.md) lists every one.

**Nothing of Nintendo's, and no ownership claimed.** nxrt contains no game code, game data, artwork, fonts or decryption
keys, and none are distributed with it. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Nintendo. Nothing here
claims ownership of any game or any part of one, and no game is licensed by this file: you need your own copy, and how
you obtained it is your business and your responsibility. Names and trademarks belong to their owners.

**No promises.** Don't expect it to do anything in particular, work on your game, or keep working. If it breaks
something, that is not on the authors.
